<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mt-2">About SetupKaro</h1>
<p class="mt-3 leading-7">SetupKaro.in is a budget toolkit for Indian creators and freelancers. We build free calculators (freelance rate, Upwork fees, YouTube budget builder) and test budget gear for noisy Indian rooms - fan, traffic, small rooms.</p>
<p class="mt-2 leading-7">Why: most “best” lists show US prices. We show INR, OTG issues on Xiaomi/Realme, and real total under Rs 5000.</p>
<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Run by Noyel G, India. Contact: setupkaro.in/contact. Updated Sept 2026.</p>
